# PA_WFMS - Workflow Management System

## Project Overview
A React-based Workflow Management System built with Material UI, React Router, and React Calendar. Features include attendance tracking, task management, and a dashboard.

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: React 18.2.0, React Router DOM 7.1.5
- **UI Framework**: Material UI (MUI) 5.13.3 (@mui/material, @mui/icons-material, @emotion/react, @emotion/styled)
- **Calendar**: react-calendar 5.1.0
- **Build Tool**: react-scripts 5.0.1
- **Language**: JavaScript (ES6+)

## Project Structure
```
src/
├── index.js                 # Entry point
├── App.js                   # Main app with routing
├── styles.css               # Global styles
├── assets/
│   └── Providence_Adwork_Light_Logo.png
├── components/
│   ├── Navbar.js            # Top navigation bar
│   ├── BottomNav.js         # Bottom navigation (mobile)
│   ├── LoginPage.js         # Login page (incomplete)
│   ├── PostCards.js         # Dashboard cards
│   └── SubComponent/
│       ├── Attendence/
│       │   ├── Attendence.js        # Attendance page wrapper
│       │   └── AttendenceCalender.js # Calendar component
│       └── Task/
│           └── TaskManager.js       # Kanban-style task board
├── pages/
│   └── Home.js              # Dashboard home page
└── data/
    └── attendanceData.js    # Static attendance data (30 days)
```

## Features Implemented

### 1. Navigation & Layout
- **Navbar**: Top app bar with menu, logo placeholder, user avatar dropdown (Profile, Account, Dashboard, Logout)
- **BottomNav**: Fixed bottom navigation for mobile (Recents, Dashboard, Tasks)
- **Routing**: React Router with 3 routes: `/`, `/attendence`, `/task`

### 2. Home Dashboard (`/`)
- Grid of PostCards for: Effort/Attendance Calendar, Tasks, CDP, Meeting, Creative Team, Attendance/Defaulters
- Click navigation to Attendance and Tasks pages

### 3. Attendance Calendar (`/attendence`)
- Monthly calendar view using react-calendar
- Custom tile content showing attendance status (P, WOFF, L-APR)
- Date selection shows detailed attendance (In Time, Out Time, Status)
- Static data for 30 days (hardcoded month)
- "Back to Home" button

### 4. Task Manager (`/task`)
- Kanban-style board with 4 columns: ToDo, In Progress, On Hold, Done
- Sprint selector (Sprint 1, Sprint 2) with hardcoded date ranges
- Task cards showing title, description, assignee
- Static task data (4 tasks across 2 sprints)
- "Back to Home" button

### 5. PostCards Component
- Reusable card component with image, title
- Used on Home page for feature navigation

## Issues to Fix (Production Readiness)

### Critical Issues
1. **LoginPage.js** - Non-functional: duplicate Employee ID fields, no password field, no form handling, no auth logic
2. **Home.js** - PostCards missing required `image` and `alt` props (will crash)
3. **PostCards.js** - Expects `image` and `alt` props but doesn't handle missing values
4. **Navbar.js** - Logo images commented out, hardcoded user name, broken avatar URL
5. **BottomNav.js** - Navigation doesn't actually route anywhere
6. **Attendance Calendar** - Only works for one hardcoded month, no month/year navigation
7. **TaskManager** - Hardcoded 2023 dates, no persistence, no CRUD operations
7. **No authentication flow** - No protected routes, no login state management
8. **No state management** - All data is static/local

### Medium Issues
9. **Package dependencies** - react-scripts 5.0.1 may have issues with React 18
10. **No error boundaries** - Crashes will break entire app
11. **No loading states** - UX issues for async operations
12. **No responsive design testing** - Fixed pixel values in CSS
13. **Accessibility** - Missing ARIA labels, semantic HTML issues
14. **Code quality** - Console.logs, inconsistent formatting, unused imports

### Production Requirements
15. **Environment configuration** - No .env support
16. **Build optimization** - No code splitting, bundle analysis
17. **Testing** - No unit/integration tests
18. **CI/CD** - No pipeline configuration
19. **Docker** - No containerization
20. **Documentation** - No README, API docs, component docs

## API Contracts (Future)
- `POST /api/auth/login` - Employee login
- `GET /api/attendance/:month/:year` - Attendance data
- `GET /api/tasks?sprint=:id` - Task data
- `POST /api/tasks` - Create task
- `PUT /api/tasks/:id` - Update task
- `DELETE /api/tasks/:id` - Delete task

## Data Models
### Attendance Entry
```js
{
  monthDay: number,    // 1-31
  weekDay: string,     // "Mon", "Tue", etc.
  tag: string,         // "P", "WOFF", "L-APR", etc.
  inTime: string,      // "11:15AM"
  outTime: string      // "7:15PM"
}
```

### Task
```js
{
  id: number,
  title: string,
  description: string,
  status: "ToDo" | "In Progress" | "On Hold" | "Done",
  sprint: string,
  assignedTo: string,
  fromDate: string,    // ISO date
  toDate: string       // ISO date
}
```

## Routes
| Path | Component | Description |
|------|-----------|-------------|
| `/` | Home | Dashboard with feature cards |
| `/attendence` | Attendence | Attendance calendar view |
| `/task` | TaskManager | Kanban task board |

## Known Limitations
- Single month of attendance data (no persistence)
- Static task data (no backend)
- No authentication/authorization
- No responsive breakpoints tested
- No error handling for missing assets
- Hardcoded user info in Navbar